        {
          "name": "My Perspective",
          "slug": "my-perspective",
          "section": "About KnowAlgo",
          "type": "text",
          "description": "",
          "value": 8,
          "html": "<p>I bring a background in institutional investment management and electricity trading to AI driven data analytics.  \r<br>\r<br>Quickly assess risks, grab opportunities, iterate.  Your infrastructure has to be ready to pivot, to identify the new thing and stay robust under deadline.  \r<br>\r<br>You data needs to be labeled, modelled and structured correctly.\r<br>\r<br>You need visual observability to know where you are… without distraction… right now.\r<br>\r<br>You can be creative and dynamic in the moment when you have a solid core.</p>",
          "id": "81499ee0-d510-4e2a-be29-ba743bed67d4",
          "generated": true,
          "title": "My Perspective"
        },
        {
          "name": "Vocation",
          "slug": "vocation",
          "section": "About KnowAlgo",
          "type": "text",
          "description": " ",
          "value": 8,
          "html": "<p>But yield who will to their separation,<br>My object in living is to unite<br>My avocation and my vocation<br>As my two eyes make one in sight.<br>Only where love and need are one,<br>And the work is play for mortal stakes,<br>Is the deed ever really done<br> - Robert Frost<br>    Two Tramps in Mud Time</p>",
          "id": "237c6f44-aaf4-4df5-809e-202d6cd5c756",
          "generated": true,
          "title": "Vocation"
        }
      ]
    },
